GLOBAL_INDVIDIBILITY_RULE=
No constituent equality, ordered product, projection relation, closure, recursive denominator power, or tensor coordinate may be algebraically simplified, cancelled, commuted, decomposed into independent admission booleans, or substituted for the complete global constraint Tensor.

ZERO_SUM_CLOSURE_REQUIRED=
x+y+z+w=0
AND
I+I^2+I^3+I^4=0
AND
the inherited Pass-129 exact rational projection closure theorem is bound to the same proof package
AND
the u^72 phase-closure projection is bound as the unit witness
AND
the recursive denominator relation N/D⁴=D⁴ remains unresolved/false unless proved by the later exact full-symbolic evaluator.

